\centering
\caption{Control coverage against threat-model channels. \cfull{} = a control in this tier
directly targets the channel with published evaluation; \cpart{} = partial or degrading coverage;
\cnone{} = no published control. Coding criteria and per-cell citations are in the accompanying artifact (Appendix~\ref{app:openscience}).}
\label{tab:coverage}
